 the columns of $U$ as follows:\n\n- First, we compute ${u}_{1}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}_{1} & =\\frac{1}{{\\sigma }_{1}}A{v}_{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{6}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Then, we compute ${u}_{2}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{{\\sigma }_{2}}A{v}_{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ \\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}} \\\\ \\sqrt{\\frac{5}{6}}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we construct the matrices $U,$ $Σ,$ and $V:$\n\n$$\nU=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{6}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{5}{6}}\\end{bmatrix},\\,Σ=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{6} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{6}\\end{bmatrix},\\,V=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"] [17592186371390 :answer/value "$U=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{bmatrix}$ and $V=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186371391 :answer/value "$U=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$ and $V=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186371392 :answer/value "$U=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} & \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ -\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\end{bmatrix}$ and $V=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186371393 :answer/value "$U=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{6}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{5}{6}}\\end{bmatrix}$ and $V=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186371394 :answer/value "$U=\\be